_6wuE_BZoQ7kNvwFmgWI4&_nc_oc=AdrCfRx_7hYT-Ci0KpwIZCMYaHMqtJyrSVSrCVf70p7slptTRx0ASWEbmWW35cBtwK4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTr_Wa_-Kn0EqABL4s99g5a5JlDjLkLl8HTDDQn7ZLZDg&oe=6B0DB04A"}, {"file_name": "OperateElectricalBox_2026-07-17_11-53-57.png", "id": "1592123409286645", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585727769_1592123412619978_2102893736611519229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_3L17xBwX2UQ7kNvwHOQAjQ&_nc_oc=Ado87OcWYaNqZb06pcW5MTQKUaC1KHaUISoAmKb23Qp_xOdq64yDl0Jx-8SC_pIlxz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSbjT1oyGAAJy_8iK3hHdkf_olwxhlmd63yScyy7vgcZQ&oe=6B0DD208"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Swiss Safety VR: Tunnel Construction", "keywords": ["Tunnel", "Safety", "Accident", "Construction"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in a new dimension of tunnel construction safety with this highly immersive VR training experience! Experience realistic work and hazard situations from tunnel and underground construction and encounter critical safety events that can occur during everyday work below ground. Sharpen your risk awareness and learn how proactive behavior and strict adherence to safety procedures can prevent accidents.\n\nThis learning module teaches tunnel construction safety in a practical, realistic, and completely risk-free way. Experience the consequences of your decisions in challenging situations and strengthen your ability to work safely underground.", "short_description": "Practice safe behavior in tunnel and underground construction using realistic hazard scenarios. Sharpen your risk awareness and learn how proactive actions and consistent safety measures help prevent accidents."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Tunnelbau-Quadrat.png", "id": "1938813786782049", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2